"""
spotify — Terminal Spotify player with colored braille album art.

Transparent pixels in album art let the terminal background show through.

First-run setup (one time):
  1. Go to https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
  2. Click "Create app" — any name/description
  3. Add Redirect URI:  http://127.0.0.1:9090/callback
  4. Check "Web API" → Save → Settings → copy Client ID + Client Secret
  5. Run this script and enter them when prompted
  6. A browser tab opens → click "Agree" → done, tokens saved

Controls:
  space   play / pause
  →       next track
  ←       previous track  (press twice quickly to restart, once more for prev)
  + / =   volume up  5 %
  -       volume down 5 %
  q       quit

Pass --keylog to print raw key sequences and exit (for debugging).
"""

